					<div class="accordion-navigation none opacity-100">
						<button class="accordionTitle " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-1791361126462-tabpanel-2" id="accordion-1791361126462-btn-2">
							<span class="tabText"><span class="body-bold">What transactions can I make with the Simplii USD Savings Account?</span> </span>
							<span class="accordionArrow icon-arrow-down"></span>
						</button>
						<div class="content" role="region" id="accordion-1791361126462-tabpanel-2" aria-labelledby="accordion-1791361126462-btn-2" style="display: none;">
							
								




    
    
    <div class="longformtext base parbase">

    
        <div class="margins-padding no-sides no-margin-sides no-margin-top no-margin-bottom no-top no-bottom  none opacity-100     none" style=" background-color: ; border-color: ; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: cover;">
            
            
                <p><span class="body-copy">Our Simplii USD Savings Account allows you to do the following:</span></p> 
<ul class="rte-list-collection checkmark"> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Transfer funds between your Simplii CAD and Simplii USD accounts at great exchange rates</span></li> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Send U.S. dollars to the U.S. for free</span></li> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Transfer funds between multiple Simplii USD accounts</span></li> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Send a Global Money Transfer (GMT) to over 130 countries</span></li> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Order a bank draft or money order</span></li> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Receive an incoming wire</span></li> 
 <li><span class="body-copy">Deposit USD and non-USD cheques into your USD Savings Account</span></li> 
</ul>
            
            
            
            
        </div>
    


    
</div>



							
							
						</div>
					</div>
				
					<div class="accordion-navigation none opacity-100">
						<button class="accordionTitle " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-1791361126462-tabpanel-3" id="accordion-1791361126462-btn-3">
							<span class="tabText"><span class="body-bold">What is the conversion rate that will be used when converting my funds between my CAD and USD Savings Account?</span> </span>
							<span class="accordionArrow icon-arrow-down"></span>
						</button>
						<div class="content" role="region" id="accordion-1791361126462-tabpanel-3" aria-labelledby="accordion-1791361126462-btn-3" style="display: none;">
							
								




    
    
    <div class="longformtext base parbase">

    
        <div class="margins-padding no-sides no-margin-sides no-margin-top no-margin-bottom no-top no-bottom  none opacity-100     none" style=" background-color: ; border-color: ; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: cover;">
            
            
                <p><span class="body-copy">Simplii Financial will use a competitive rate to convert the funds at the time of the transaction, which will be shown to you in your Online or Mobile Banking account prior to completing the transaction. This rate is amongst one of the best exchange rates among all Canadian banks.</span></p>
            
            
            
            
        </div>
    


    
</div>



							
							
						</div>
					</div>
				
					<div class="accordion-navigation none opacity-100">
						<button class="accordionTitle " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-1791361126462-tabpanel-4" id="accordion-1791361126462-btn-4">
							<span class="tabText"><span class="body-bold">Can I deposit or withdraw cash from the USD account?</span> </span>
							<span class="accordionArrow icon-arrow-down"></span>
						</button>
						<div class="content" role="region" id="accordion-1791361126462-tabpanel-4" aria-labelledby="accordion-1791361126462-btn-4" style="display: none;">
							
								




    
    
    <div class="longformtext base parbase">

    
        <div class="margins-padding no-sides no-margin-sides no-margin-top no-margin-bottom no-top no-bottom  none opacity-100     none" style=" background-color: ; border-color: ; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: cover;">
            
            
                <p><span class="body-copy">You can order a bank draft or money order from the USD account, as well as send funds through GMT to countries outside Canada or the U.S. Unfortunately there are no cash deposits or withdrawals at this point in time.</span></p>
            
            
            
            
        </div>
    


    
</div>



							
							
						</div>
					</div>
				
					<div class="accordion-navigation none opacity-100">
						<button class="accordionTitle " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-1791361126462-tabpanel-5" id="accordion-1791361126462-btn-5">
							<span class="tabText"><span class="body-bold">Can I access my USD account at an ATM?</span> </span>
							<span class="accordionArrow icon-arrow-down"></span>
						</button>
						<div class="content" role="region" id="accordion-1791361126462-tabpanel-5" aria-labelledby="accordion-1791361126462-btn-5" style="display: none;">
							
								




    
    
    <div class="longformtext base parbase">

    
        <div class="margins-padding no-sides no-margin-sides no-margin-top no-margin-bottom no-top no-bottom  none opacity-100     none" style=" background-color: ; border-color: ; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: cover;">
            
            
                <p><span class="body-copy">Unfortunately, there is no ATM access at this point in time.</span></p>
            
            
            
            
        </div>
    


    
</div>



							
							
						</div>
					</div>
				
					<div class="accordion-navigation none opacity-100">
						<button class="accordionTitle " aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-1791361126462-tabpanel-6" id="accordion-1791361126462-btn-6">
							<span class="tabText"><span class="body-bold">Can I order or deposit cheques into the USD account?</span> </span>
							<span class="accordionArrow icon-arrow-down"></span>
						</button>
						<div class="content" role="region" id="accordion-1791361126462-tabpanel-6" aria-labelledby="accordion-1791361126462-btn-6" style="display: none;">
							
								




    
    
    <div class="longformtext base parbase">

    
        <div class="margins-padding no-sides no-margin-sides no-margin-top no-margin-bottom no-top no-bottom  none opacity-100     none" style=" background-color: ; border-color: ; background-position: center; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-size: cover;">
            
            
                <p><span class="body-copy">You can deposit USD and non-USD cheques into your account by mailing them in. Write your full name and your USD account number on the back of the cheque. Mail it to:<br> Simplii Financial<br> P.O. Box 603, Station Agincourt<br> Scarborough, Ontario<br> </span>M1S5K9</p>
            
            
            
            
        </div>
    


    
</div>



							
							
						</div>
